    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d545">

                <pb facs="0730" n="640" sameAs="frus:frus1934v03/pg640"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.94/934</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-04-03">April 3, 1934</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Japanese Ambassador called and handed me certain translations<anchor n="17"
                        xml:id="d545-f1"/> of Japanese papers regarding the recent exchange of notes
                    between the Foreign Minister of his Government and myself. They were unanimous
                    in their favorable tone and comment. I thanked him for his courtesy in bringing
                    them to me and expressed my gratification to learn of this favorable reaction in
                    the press of his country.</p>
                <closer><signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ull</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
